  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Eragrostis pilosa",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_pilosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1245498769,
      "text": "Eragrostis pilosa is a species of grass in the family Poaceae. It is native to Eurasia and Africa. It may or may not be native to North America. It is widely introduced, and it is a common weed in many areas."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Eragrostis pilosa",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_pilosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 207976994,
      "text": "Eragrostis pilosa, l'éragrostide poilue, est une espèce de plantes monocotylédones de la famille des Poaceae (graminées), sous-famille des Chloridoideae, originaire des régions tropicales et tempérées chaudes de l'hémisphère nord.\nCe sont des plantes herbacées annuelles, aux tiges (chaumes) dressées géniculées ascendantes pouvant atteindre 70 cm de long, et aux inflorescences en panicule."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Eragrostis pilosa",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_pilosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 40538032,
      "text": "Eragrostis pilosa é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Poaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Eragrostis pilosa",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_pilosa",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29901600,
      "text": "Eragrostis pilosa adalah sebuah spesies rumput. Spesies tersebut berasal dari Eurasia dan Afrika. Spesies tersebut mungkin atau mungkin bukan berasal dari Amerika Utara. Spesies tersebut menjadi spesies spesies di wilayah lainnyam, dan menjadi gulma di banyak wilayah."
    }
  },
